    linkml:description """A comprehensive LinkML schema modeling ISMS entities, workflows, and traceability links aligned to ISO/IEC 27001:2022 clause and Annex references. Designed for open data publication, automated validation, and integration with governance, risk, and compliance (GRC) systems.
This schema captures: - ISMS lifecycle (establish, implement, maintain, improve) - Risk assessment and treatment processes (Clause 6.1) - Annex A control catalog structures organized by domain - Audit, measurement, and continual improvement artifacts""" ;
